thoritative corridor-level documentation. Several records therefore use clearly bounded civic, park, or historic-district areas rather than inventing student districts or reducing the bucket to isolated businesses.","The input file states current_date 2026-08-13, while the execution environment date is 2026-08-12; source_fetched_at and researched_at use the execution environment’s date.","Many campus spaces do not publish room-level reservation or weekend-access rules. Their access_notes preserve those uncertainties rather than implying unrestricted availability.","The 2025–26 dining PDF is the strongest directly accessible source for Market Place evening service, but hours should be rechecked for later academic years and breaks."]}
