{"complete":true,"school_name":"Gustavus Adolphus College","town_name":"Saint Peter","template_id":"college-first-weekend","title":"Your First Weekend at Gustavus Adolphus College, Shared as Cards","description":"A Friday-to-Sunday sequence for meeting your orientation circle, learning key campus landmarks, and making a careful first trip into Saint Peter.","icon":"schedule","cards":[{"subject_id":"gustie-greeter","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Gustie Greeter","title":"Friday Arrival: Find Your Gustie Greeter","subtitle":"Start with the student leader assigned to your orientation group.","notes":"Ask where your group meets, how schedule updates arrive, and which weekend questions are better handled by your faculty partner.","short_summary":"Make your assigned Greeter the first reference point for the weekend.","evidence_claim":"Gustie Greeters are upper-class student leaders who welcome new students, answer questions, and lead small Orientation Groups.","source_url":"https://gustavus.edu/admission-aid/new-students/orientation","source_title":"Orientation | Gustavus Adolphus College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"This stop applies during official New Student Orientation; follow the current schedule supplied to incoming students.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"orientation-group","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Orientation Group","title":"Friday Afternoon: Meet Your Orientation Group","subtitle":"Learn a few names before the weekend schedule gets busy.","notes":"Introduce yourself, save the group’s next meeting point, and identify one person to contact if you become separated during activities.","short_summary":"Use the small-group session to establish a practical weekend contact circle.","evidence_claim":"Each new student is placed in a small Orientation Group led by a Gustie Greeter and a faculty partner.","source_url":"https://gustavus.edu/admission-aid/new-students/orientation","source_title":"Orientation | Gustavus Adolphus College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The activity is for incoming students during Orientation; meeting details come from the current official schedule.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"old-main","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Old Main","title":"Friday Afternoon: Set Old Main as a Landmark","subtitle":"Use the hilltop academic building to orient yourself on campus.","notes":"Pause outside to fix the building in memory, then note which direction leads back toward your residence hall and the campus center.","short_summary":"Anchor your mental map at Gustavus’s original Saint Peter building.","evidence_claim":"Old Main was the first Gustavus college building in Saint Peter and remains an active academic building housing several departments and the Chaplains’ Office.","source_url":"https://gustavus.edu/about/facilities/old-main","source_title":"Old Main | Gustavus Adolphus College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Exterior viewing is the dependable weekend option; the source does not establish unrestricted building access.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"painting-the-rock","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Painting the Rock","title":"Friday Evening: Read the Rock","subtitle":"See what message is currently displayed near Old Main.","notes":"Read the current message and take a photo if useful; only add paint after checking present campus expectations and coordinating supplies.","short_summary":"Encounter a changeable campus message board in physical form.","evidence_claim":"Gustavus documents p